+OldaleTown_Text_MiraIntroduction:
+	.string "MIRA: I map the sounds of rivers.\n"
+	.string "Usually, rivers don't answer back.\p"
+	.string "Then IVO sent me three notes from\n"
+	.string "LITTLEROOT. My receiver replied!\p"
+	.string "And your LUMIFIN is keeping time\n"
+	.string "with it. Look at those fins!\p"
+	.string "I thought the signal was a warning.\n"
+	.string "Your partner seems less certain.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraAccept:
+	.string "Will you and LUMIFIN help me\n"
+	.string "follow the river's reply?$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraDeclined:
+	.string "MIRA: Take your time. A good\n"
+	.string "listener never rushes an answer.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraNeedsLumifin:
+	.string "MIRA: IVO found an egg by the\n"
+	.string "LITTLEROOT beacon. Did it hatch?\p"
+	.string "Bring that LUMIFIN in your party.\n"
+	.string "I think it can hear my receiver.\p"
+	.string "If it is in a PC BOX, withdraw it\n"
+	.string "at the POKéMON CENTER nearby.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraRelayDirections:
+	.string "MIRA: On ROUTE 101, find the cyan\n"
+	.string "relay just above the route sign.\p"
+	.string "Take LUMIFIN there. Listen for the\n"
+	.string "pause after the first three notes.\p"
+	.string "Come back and tell me what your\n"
+	.string "partner hears in that silence.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraRelayReport:
+	.string "MIRA: Three notes, then two?\n"
+	.string "My recorder heard only the first!\p"
+	.string "LUMIFIN heard the reply before\n"
+	.string "the receiver could pick it up.\p"
+	.string "The river bends north of here.\n"
+	.string "An old survey beacon stands there.\p"
+	.string "Let's test a new idea: perhaps\n"
+	.string "something is asking for a guide.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraNorthDirections:
+	.string "MIRA: Go north to ROUTE 103.\n"
+	.string "Find the cyan beacon by the water.\p"
+	.string "Stay on this side of the river.\n"
+	.string "You won't need to SURF.\p"
+	.string "A restless POOCHYENA circles it.\n"
+	.string "Let LUMIFIN lead your party.\p"
+	.string "Heal at the CENTER before you go.\n"
+	.string "Then inspect the beacon together.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraHomeDirections:
+	.string "MIRA: A route for young POKéMON!\n"
+	.string "The signal keeps them together.\p"
+	.string "Go back to the LITTLEROOT beacon.\n"
+	.string "Let LUMIFIN answer the last note.\p"
+	.string "Then return here. We should know\n"
+	.string "whether the river heard us.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraFinalReport:
+	.string "MIRA: Every relay answered!\n"
+	.string "You brought the route back to life.\p"
+	.string "These are no distress calls.\n"
+	.string "They're instructions for a journey.\p"
+	.string "LUMIFIN isn't our test subject.\n"
+	.string "It's our first river guide.\p"
+	.string "Someone built those beacons to\n"
+	.string "listen to partners like yours.\p"
+	.string "Who? That's the next question.\n"
+	.string "For now, take these for the road.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraThanks:
+	.string "MIRA: I've healed your team, too.\n"
+	.string "A guide deserves a little rest.\p"
+	.string "Save your adventure. LUMIFIN has\n"
+	.string "earned a place in our field notes.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraComplete:
+	.string "MIRA: Visit the field lab in the\n"
+	.string "northwest house. Our family grows!\p"
+	.string "MIRA: The river route is awake.\n"
+	.string "LUMIFIN taught us how to listen.\p"
+	.string "The north beacon can still draw\n"
+	.string "POOCHYENA out for battle practice.\p"
+	.string "A PC BOX won't change your partner.\n"
+	.string "Its identity travels with it.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraBagFull:
+	.string "MIRA: Make room for three POTIONS,\n"
+	.string "then come back for your supplies.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_MiraUnknown:
+	.string "MIRA: These field notes are unclear.\n"
+	.string "Let's leave them as they are.$"
+
+@ North Pool v1: a prepared adventure owns its causal grammar and family.
+@ The original quest remains 6. Lab clue 1 still means its reward succeeded.
+#if AURORA_ADVENTURE_VARIANT != 0
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthPool::
+	goto_if_eq VAR_AURORA_NORTH_POOL, AURORA_NORTH_COMPLETE, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthComplete
+	goto_if_ne VAR_AURORA_LAB_CLUE, 1, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthLabReminder
+	special GetAuroraAdventureState
+	goto_if_ne VAR_RESULT, 1, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthFamilyReminder
+	goto_if_eq VAR_AURORA_NORTH_POOL, AURORA_NORTH_UNMET, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthOffer
+#if AURORA_ADVENTURE_VARIANT == 1
+	goto_if_eq VAR_AURORA_NORTH_POOL, AURORA_NORTH_BATTLE_WON, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthReward
+	goto_if_eq VAR_AURORA_NORTH_CLUES, AURORA_NORTH_REED, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthBattleReminder
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthReedReminder
+#else
+	goto_if_ne VAR_AURORA_NORTH_POOL, AURORA_NORTH_BATTLE_WON, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthBattleReminder
+	goto_if_eq VAR_AURORA_NORTH_CLUES, AURORA_NORTH_ALL_CLUES, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthReward
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthBothClues, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraFinish
+#endif
+
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthOffer::
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthOffer, MSGBOX_YESNO
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, NO, OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraDeclined
+	setvar VAR_AURORA_NORTH_POOL, AURORA_NORTH_ACCEPTED
+#if AURORA_ADVENTURE_VARIANT == 1
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthReedReminder
+#else
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthBattleReminder
+#endif
+
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthReedReminder::
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthReed, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraFinish
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthBattleReminder::
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthBattle, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraFinish
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthLabReminder::
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthLabReminder, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraFinish
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthFamilyReminder::
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthFamilyReminder, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraFinish
+
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthReward::
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthConclusion, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	giveitem ITEM_SUPER_POTION, 2
+	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthBagFull
+	setvar VAR_AURORA_NORTH_POOL, AURORA_NORTH_COMPLETE
+	special HealPlayerParty
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthThanks, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraFinish
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthBagFull::
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthBagFull, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraFinish
+OldaleTown_EventScript_NorthComplete::
+	msgbox OldaleTown_Text_NorthComplete, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
+	goto OldaleTown_EventScript_MiraFinish
+
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthOffer:
+#if AURORA_ADVENTURE_VARIANT == 1
+	.string "MIRA: NORTH POOL is a nursery!\n"
+	.string "A reed marker knows its quiet path.\p"
+	.string "Will your new family help me\n"
+	.string "find the nursery's lost entrance?$"
+#else
+	.string "MIRA: NORTH POOL has two channels.\n"
+	.string "Something has silenced them both.\p"
+	.string "Will your new family help me\n"
+	.string "reunite the nursery's two voices?$"
+#endif
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthReed:
+	.string "MIRA: Go north to ROUTE 103.\n"
+	.string "Find the REED MARKER west of\l"
+	.string "the beacon by the river.\p"
+	.string "Bring a healthy family partner.\n"
+	.string "The marker reveals the safe note.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthBattle:
+	.string "MIRA: Find the river beacon on\n"
+	.string "ROUTE 103, beside the west bank.\p"
+	.string "Two restless POKéMON guard it.\n"
+	.string "Both new partners must lead.\p"
+	.string "Put them first and second, healthy.\n"
+	.string "No SURF is needed to reach it.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthBothClues:
+	.string "MIRA: Read both markers on ROUTE\n"
+	.string "103, west of the river beacon.\p"
+	.string "REED is near the beacon. STONE\n"
+	.string "is farther west. Either comes first.\p"
+	.string "Bring a healthy family partner.\n"
+	.string "Then tell me what joins the notes.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthLabReminder:
+	.string "MIRA: First visit the field lab\n"
+	.string "in the northwest house.\p"
+	.string "Let mature, edited RIPPLE listen.\n"
+	.string "Collect the lab's POKé BALL.\p"
+	.string "That confirms NORTH POOL in our\n"
+	.string "notes. Make Bag room if needed.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthFamilyReminder:
+	.string "MIRA: The field lab has a new\n"
+	.string "family ready for this adventure.\p"
+	.string "Visit the northwest house with\n"
+	.string "two free places in your party.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthConclusion:
+#if AURORA_ADVENTURE_VARIANT == 1
+	.string "MIRA: The reed taught us the note.\n"
+	.string "Your family carried it to the pool.\p"
+	.string "Now the entrance stays quiet.\n"
+	.string "Young POKéMON can return safely.$"
+#else
+	.string "MIRA: First you calmed the pool.\n"
+	.string "Then both channels answered.\p"
+	.string "The reed marks outgoing calls;\n"
+	.string "the stone marks replies.\p"
+	.string "Together they form a nursery map.\n"
+	.string "One clue alone hid its purpose!$"
+#endif
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthThanks:
+	.string "MIRA: Supplies for your family,\n"
+	.string "and a well-earned rest.\p"
+	.string "Save your adventure. The nursery\n"
+	.string "will remember this discovery.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthBagFull:
+	.string "MIRA: Make room for two\n"
+	.string "SUPER POTIONS, then return.\p"
+	.string "Your discovery is still recorded.\n"
+	.string "I will keep the supplies here.$"
+OldaleTown_Text_NorthComplete:
+	.string "MIRA: NORTH POOL is safe.\n"
+	.string "Your family's discovery is recorded.\p"
+	.string "The river beacon offers practice.\n"
+	.string "The markers remember your notes.$"
+#endif
