+	.string "LUMIFIN heard them coming.\p"
+	.string "The relay points toward a river,\n"
+	.string "beyond the houses of OLDALE.\p"
+	.string "Tell MIRA what you heard.$"
+Route101_Text_AuroraRelayRead:
+	.string "Three notes. A pause. Two replies.\n"
+	.string "LUMIFIN follows the quiet part.\p"
+	.string "MIRA in OLDALE is mapping\n"
+	.string "where the signal goes.$"
